{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233520","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233520","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423352001:1":{"text":"제이미, 헤리나 부인. 잘 지내셨나요?","source_cn":"詹米，胡丽诺女士，你们最近过得怎么样呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x483B6B98B6B64F1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423352002:1":{"text":"지난번에 다녀가신 이후로 제이미가 계속 누나 얘기를 했어요. 제이미, 오로나 누나에게 인사해야지!","source_cn":"自从你上次离开后，詹米一直念叨着你呢。詹米，跟欧罗娜小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x420C455DEEDABECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423352003:1":{"text":"...누나, 다시 만나서... 너무 기뻐요! 누가 저에게 선물을 준 건 처음이었거든요.","source_cn":"……大姐姐，能再见到你……我好高兴！有人送我礼物，还是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D98432AE373010C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423352004:1":{"text":"마음에 들었다니 다행이네요! 지난번에는 책 한 권이었지만, 이번에는 많이 가져왔답니다. 친구들이랑 같이 봐도 좋아요!","source_cn":"你喜欢就好！上次我只带了一本书，这次我给你带了好多书呢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507B202C00D34B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423352005:1":{"text":"...누나, 정말 고마워요...","source_cn":"……大姐姐，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E32E6951A849070","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423352006:1":{"text":"아! 이분은 프라벨 선생님과 학생들이에요. 셀로클랜드에 대해 알고 싶다고 하시더라고요.","source_cn":"对了！这是芙拉贝尔老师和她的学生，她们想了解和萨洛克兰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09ECF708E2F0C93C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423352007:1":{"text":"제이미, 안녕! 난 바투소 산맥에서 온 플로라야!","source_cn":"詹米你好！我是来自瓦度索山脉的花灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1530CFA0D2BC51EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1423352007":{"text":"제이미, 안녕! 난 바투소 산맥에서 온 플로라야!","source_cn":"詹米你好！我是来自瓦度索山脉的花灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1530CFA0D2BC51EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423352008:1":{"text":"아, 안녕...","source_cn":"你、你好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB704EF65C4A86B9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423352009:1":{"text":"제이미, 너는 계속 여기서 살았으니 주변 자연 환경에 대해 잘 알겠지?","source_cn":"詹米，你一直生活在这里，对这里的自然环境应该很熟悉吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB249DAAEABF30F86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_